{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>הולך וחזק</b> (going and growing stronger) — twice in the Masorah: here and the other: ודוד הולך וחזק, as stated in Eruvin. David revealed a tractate called הולך וחזק; Saul did not reveal a tractate, for it is written הולכים ודלים, and this is ודוד הולך וחזק — in the Torah, in which הולך וחזק מאד is written."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:39.128308002Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}